Error [E0932]: `#Deprecated` requires a public item
  --> tests/ui/deprecated_marker_private.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     #Deprecated(since: "2027", use: "parse")
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The lifecycle marker retires stable public declarations; an item inside a `priv module` is not part of the public surface
 Fix: Move the item out of its `priv module`, or remove `#Deprecated`
